<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<elements>
	<info>
		<name>Dreamer</name>
		<description>Dreamer background — Sylvanreach, ATÉRIOR.</description>
		<author>Falling-Cats</author>
		<update version="0.0.1">
			<file name="background-dreamer.xml" url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Falling-Cats/aterior-aurora/main/Backgrounds/background-dreamer.xml" />
		</update>
	</info>
	<element name="Dreamer" type="Background" source="ATÉRIOR" id="ID_ATERIOR_BACKGROUND_DREAMER">
		<description>
			<ul class="unstyled" style="text-indent:-1em; margin-left:1em; margin-bottom:5px">
				<li><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Wisdom</li>
				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Lucky</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Athletics</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Herbalism Kit</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Climber's Kit, Bedroll, Waterskin, Traveler's Clothes, 15 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>The Skyroot Tree sent you dreams as a child — visions calling you to climb. You answered, and you survived the trial's early stages, but the crown never came to you: you fell short, or you turned away before the final ascent. Either way, something in you still listens for that call.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="short">Strength, Constitution, Wisdom, Lucky Feat, Insight and Athletics Skills, Herbalism Kit</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<grant type="Ability Score Improvement" id="ID_INTERNAL_ABILITY_SCORE_IMPROVEMENT_COMBINATION_STR_CON_WIS" />
			<grant type="Feat" id="ID_WOTC_PHB24_FEAT_LUCKY" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_INSIGHT" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_ATHLETICS" />
			<grant type="Grants" id="ID_INTERNAL_GRANTS_BACKGROUND_ASI" />
			<grant type="Proficiency" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_TOOL_PROFICIENCY_HERBALISM_KIT" />
		</rules>
	</element>
</elements>
